989	7e91f0a2-cd90-43c3-b0f2-4c28576dcef5	other	Never imitate what you do not understand... the end may be deeply painful and catastrophic. A curious monkey watched a carpenter splitting a massive tree trunk. The carpenter hammered a wedge into the cleft to keep it open, then left to rest. The arrogant monkey leaped down, sitting atop the log to play the carpenter... unaware that his long tail was dangling dangerously deep into the crack. In a moment of blind folly, he reached out and forcefully pulled the wedge! The heavy trunk snapped shut instantly upon his tail. The monkey shrieked in unimaginable agony, paying the ultimate price in blood. The lesson: He who meddles in a craft he hasn't mastered, destroys himself. Focus on your own battles, and leave the tools of others alone.	fable		fable	1	mp3	8f43376e-bc1e-4692-8fa4-6ccebd3197e1	COMPLETED	/app/media/audio_files/26344687-23cb-40fe-b877-f0c805c4d90f_7e91f0a2-cd90-43c3-b0f2-4c28576dcef5.mp3		617	2026-04-25 16:37:09.516797+00	2026-04-25 16:37:21.653881+00	26344687-23cb-40fe-b877-f0c805c4d90f
