1003	64dd6e53-c453-4af4-bc73-cbf05fee1819	other	Think you can fool everyone forever? Watch out, because your own trap might just kill you! An old, starving heron couldn't hunt anymore, so he came up with a sick trick. He panicked the fish, saying fishermen were coming, and offered to fly them to a safe pond. Every day he took a few... but he just flew them to a nearby hill and ate them alive. Then, a crab asked for a ride. High in the air, the crab looked down and saw a massive pile of fish bones. Knowing he was next, he locked his claws onto the bird's neck and snapped it! The takeaway: What goes around comes around. A scammer might win for a while, but eventually, their own lies will choke them out.	fable		fable	1	mp3	ea8f56c1-adca-404b-bf15-f4d88b44257c	COMPLETED	/app/media/audio_files/26344687-23cb-40fe-b877-f0c805c4d90f_64dd6e53-c453-4af4-bc73-cbf05fee1819.mp3		535	2026-04-25 18:06:41.979175+00	2026-04-25 18:06:51.580058+00	26344687-23cb-40fe-b877-f0c805c4d90f
1007	d0c70307-8875-4dab-898c-43d1c65865b5	other	How does the weakest creature in the forest slay its most ferocious beast? A tyrannical lion mercilessly devoured the forest's inhabitants. One day, it was a small rabbit's turn to be the meal. But the rabbit deliberately arrived late. Furious, the lion demanded an explanation. The cunning rabbit replied, "Another lion intercepted me, stole your meal, and proclaimed himself the new king!" The arrogant lion went mad with rage. The rabbit led him to a deep well. Gazing down, the lion saw his own reflection and mistook it for the enemy! He roared and plunged into the abyss to fight, drowning forever. The moral: Quiet intellect conquers brute force. Physical might may intimidate the weak, but the mind is the ultimate weapon of survival.	fable		fable	1	mp3	1e53b536-5ae3-4720-8f32-bd4370d5b3b4	COMPLETED	/app/media/audio_files/26344687-23cb-40fe-b877-f0c805c4d90f_d0c70307-8875-4dab-898c-43d1c65865b5.mp3		619	2026-04-25 18:18:20.673921+00	2026-04-25 18:18:31.480561+00	26344687-23cb-40fe-b877-f0c805c4d90f
