999	05960565-c256-4b2e-9fbc-66d529db8068	other	How does one conquer an adversary vastly superior in strength... without landing a single blow? A despairing crow suffered the endless loss of his fledglings to a monstrous serpent dwelling beneath his tree. Blinded by fury, he wished to attack directly, but a cunning jackal intervened: "Do not fight with your body; fight with your mind." The crow pilfered a radiant golden necklace from the royal palace, flying deliberately slow so the king's guards would pursue him. Upon reaching his tree, he dropped the treasure directly into the serpent's lair! The armed guards arrived, slew the beast to retrieve the gold, and the reign of terror ended. The moral: Intellect conquers brute force. That which cannot be defeated by physical might, can easily be dismantled by superior strategy.	fable		fable	1	mp3	d90a4b05-2990-4787-ac57-064b531bd748	COMPLETED	/app/media/audio_files/26344687-23cb-40fe-b877-f0c805c4d90f_05960565-c256-4b2e-9fbc-66d529db8068.mp3		659	2026-04-25 17:50:43.486912+00	2026-04-25 17:50:53.810125+00	26344687-23cb-40fe-b877-f0c805c4d90f
