1096	fdcd9fe8-2043-4968-8785-fc1353842be2	other	How do you face peril? Your first instinct dictates whether you survive or perish! In a shadowy pool lived three fish. Overhearing fishermen plotting their capture, the first fish—resolute and swift—fled instantly to the river. The second hesitated until the exit was blocked. Driven to deception, she feigned death. Tossed onto the bank by a fisherman, she narrowly leapt to freedom. As for the third, weak and irresolute... she simply thrashed about in blind panic, easily falling into the net to meet her doom. The moral: Decisiveness saves you, cunning might barely spare you, but hesitation and helplessness are the absolute path to ruin.	fable		fable	1	mp3	8049eae6-d1fe-4cd6-a05c-49e7c6f362fe	COMPLETED	/app/media/audio_files/26344687-23cb-40fe-b877-f0c805c4d90f_fdcd9fe8-2043-4968-8785-fc1353842be2.mp3		540	2026-04-26 19:38:44.514088+00	2026-04-26 19:38:54.558377+00	26344687-23cb-40fe-b877-f0c805c4d90f
