1097	33ee783d-cb6f-4a70-878f-e9b22ee6d1a1	other	How do you handle danger? What you do in the first second determines if you live or die! Three fish lived in a dark pond. They heard fishermen planning to catch them. The first fish, decisive and smart, instantly swam down the river to escape. The second fish waited until the exit was blocked. Forced to improvise, she played dead. A fisherman threw her on the bank, and she barely jumped to safety. But the third fish was completely helpless. She just swam in circles out of panic, easily getting caught in the net and meeting her end. The takeaway: Quick action saves you, a smart trick might keep you alive, but hesitation and doing nothing will absolutely destroy you.	echo		echo	1	mp3	648ccddb-27eb-4ba2-a0c6-6fcbb4594dd9	COMPLETED	/app/media/audio_files/26344687-23cb-40fe-b877-f0c805c4d90f_33ee783d-cb6f-4a70-878f-e9b22ee6d1a1.mp3		554	2026-04-26 19:41:10.39689+00	2026-04-26 19:41:20.853854+00	26344687-23cb-40fe-b877-f0c805c4d90f
