1101	34c7f940-df74-45dc-9ace-a7e1f06322e3	other	A single spoken word could cost your life... can you master the art of silence? Two ducks and a turtle lived in a drying pond. As the ducks prepared to migrate, the desperate turtle begged to join them. They presented a stout branch: "Bite the centre... and whatever you hear, do not utter a single word." They took to the skies. Below, villagers scoffed, "How absurd! A flying turtle!" Infuriated by the mockery, the foolish turtle snapped to curse them! The moment her jaws parted, she plummeted to the unforgiving earth, shattering her shell. The moral: A loose tongue is the architect of one's own ruin. Silence in the face of provocation is not weakness; it is your greatest strength.	fable		fable	1	mp3	e3662cfc-3ae8-4439-ab26-2b8cd747b2b3	COMPLETED	/app/media/audio_files/26344687-23cb-40fe-b877-f0c805c4d90f_34c7f940-df74-45dc-9ace-a7e1f06322e3.mp3		570	2026-04-26 19:55:07.293092+00	2026-04-26 19:55:17.200641+00	26344687-23cb-40fe-b877-f0c805c4d90f
